# The gate payload and the checks that guard this repo's own rules are owned
# by the maintainer: a change there needs their review (dogfooding the
# `ci-gate` CODEOWNERS rule — see templates/ci-gate/CODEOWNERS).
# Enforcement is a repo setting, not this file. Chosen 2026-08-22: branch
# protection on `main` with required status checks (lint, secret-scan),
# enforce_admins and no force-push — WITHOUT required code-owner review, because
# a solo repo cannot approve its own PRs and a rule that blocks every PR gets
# removed. Flip `require_code_owner_reviews` on the day a second reviewer exists.
/templates/ci-gate/   @umar-s
/scripts/             @umar-s
/tests/               @umar-s
/.github/             @umar-s
/CODEOWNERS           @umar-s
